    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d517">

                <pb facs="0916" n="816" sameAs="frus:frus1880/pg816"/>

                <head>No. 517.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Birney to Mr. Evarts.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The
                                Hague</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1880-09-30"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">September</hi> 30, 1880</date>. (Received
                        October 13.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 162.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to state that the annual
                    session of the Staats General of the Kingdom of the Netherlands was, in usual
                    form, opened by His Majesty the King on the 20th instant. Of the address read by
                    His Majesty I herewith inclose copies in Dutch and French, with a
                    translation.</p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>JAMES BIRNEY.</signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d517-a1.xml" xpointer="d517-a1"/>
            </div>
